### Modular Monolith Shop HTTP Scratchpad
### Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client Format

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Checks
GET {{host}}/health/live

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

###
GET {{host}}/health/modules

### 2. OpenAPI Specification
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### 3. Generate Dev Tokens (Non-Production Only)
# @name adminTokenRequest
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "admin_carol",
  "displayName": "Carol Administrator",
  "scopes": ["shop.admin", "shop.customer"]
}

###
@adminToken = {{adminTokenRequest.response.body.token}}

# @name customerTokenRequest
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "cust_alice",
  "displayName": "Alice Customer",
  "scopes": ["shop.customer"]
}

###
@customerToken = {{customerTokenRequest.response.body.token}}

### 4. Catalog Management (Admin)
# @name createProduct
POST {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-MECHANICAL-KEYBOARD",
  "name": "Custom Mechanical Keyboard 75%",
  "description": "Hot-swappable tactile mechanical keyboard with PBT keycaps.",
  "price": 149.99
}

###
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### List Products in Catalog (Customer or Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Get Specific Product by ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. Inventory Management (Admin)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/inventory/stock/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 100
}

### Check Stock Level
GET {{host}}/api/v1/inventory/stock/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. Order Placement (Customer) - Idempotent Saga Execution
# @name placeOrder
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ordering/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-req-2026-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.id}}

### Replay Same Order Request (Demonstrates Idempotent Replay)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ordering/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-req-2026-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Order Status & History (Customer)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ordering/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### List Customer Orders
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ordering/orders?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 8. Payment Attempt Inspection (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Customer Notifications
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Order Cancellation (Customer)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ordering/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
